  <!-- Voicings combine E/A barre, C/G open-position and low-D shapes, adapted to six notes. -->
  <!-- Chord voicings are transposed up one octave from their guitar-inspired register. -->
  <!-- Every chord starts on its root; repeated roots in the last four rows use alternate voicings. -->
  <!-- Column 2: major. Mixed guitar-inspired voicings; root first, then ascending notes. -->
